fact WorkItem(id: "WI-574", description: some(value: "WI-502 Step 6 — Generative labeling (deferred). When forward progress needs an underdetermined type (requires Numeric[?T] with ?T unbound), ENUMERATE admissible instances — dispatch under uncertainty IS labeling (CLP(FD) labeling; CHR propagation = limitation-becomes-generation). Opt-in, same representation as Steps 1-5: check+suspend ships in Step 5, generation deferred. Bound to the decidable fragment (sort-lattice subsort, instance facts, disequality); arbitrary-predicate / full-refinement constraints are out of scope (the door opened deliberately, not by drift). See docs/design/constrained-term-substrate.md Step 6. Acceptance: cargo-test green via scripts/test.sh (when picked up)."), context: none, acceptance: [ToolPasses(tool: "cargo-test", params: none)], depends_on: some(value: ["WI-292"]), generates: none, requires_capability: none, status: PreOpened)

